    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπετάννῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spread out over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ λῖτα πετάσσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.441
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1459
			</span></i> (lyr., tm.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρρεις πρό τινος
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				91.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spread</i> or <i>cover with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν αὐλὴν δικτύοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					132
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλὴν φοινικίδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					731
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστίῳ ἀνθρώπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					131b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι ἱματίοις καταπεπταμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.3.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
